{
  "bookId": "rewind-28",
  "id": "chapter-107",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27000001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "原味崽",
          "text": "跑啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "大家快逃！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "简直太可怕了！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼哼哼哼哈哈哈哈。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "看来本王的布置发挥了完美的效用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这些手办都被我设计的陷阱震慑了，都在惊慌失措的逃跑吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "等它们跑过来，本王再跳出去，一定会给他们巨大的惊喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "救命啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "有没有谁来救救我们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼哼哼，很可惜，不会有人来救你们了，因为……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "等等，你们都在往哪逃，本王就在这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "别拦我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "什么魔王，我们不熟！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "快跑啊，不然那个怪物就要追过来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "？？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "什么怪物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "传说中的光之巨人，不过……这次在我们这里出现的，是黑暗的巨人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "你没看到，他一击就打烂了一个箱子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "我怎么看到他一拳踢倒了一棵树！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "原味崽",
          "text": "一拳踢倒是什么鬼，难道不是一辆车被他弄坏了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "总而言之就是非常可怕，你也赶紧逃命吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "原味崽",
          "text": "没错！和他靠的太近，就算不被杀，也可能会被黑暗的力量污染。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "说不定到时候会变成怪物，被管理局干掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27000024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你们都在说什么乱七八糟的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-582",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "aoteman",
          "rowIds": [
            27000001,
            27000002,
