          ],
          "sectionId": 27000
        }
      ],
      "title": "黑暗迪迦·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27001001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "黑暗迪迦，什么啊，突然跑出这种莫名其妙的家伙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "莉可大魔王才不会输给这种家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "竟然敢抢走我魔王的名气，真是可恶。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "还有那陷阱又是怎么回事，难道没有触发吗？明明是很完美的设计来着。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猫",
          "text": "喵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "难怪，陷阱没有触发，原来是被这只蠢猫破坏掉了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "可恶，明明那些家伙该被我的陷阱吓跑的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "给我滚远点，臭猫。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "小心我用石头砸你哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猫",
          "text": "喵！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "啧，区区一只坏猫，也敢挑衅莉可大魔王的威严，看来你真是不懂哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "很多猫",
          "text": "喵！喵！喵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "呜哇！！这个是什么，什么时候跑来这么多猫？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "别以为我是怕了你们，只是今天不想和你们这群家伙计较罢了，以后给我等着瞧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "很多猫",
          "text": "喵！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "唔！！竟然，竟然追过来了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27001017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "果然只能战斗了吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27020001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27020002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这又是什么，等等，你做什么，放我下来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-583",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "aoteman",
          "rowIds": [
            27001001,
            27001002,
            27001003,
            27001004,
            27001005,
